# --- Large result artifacts (regenerable from cards + pipeline; keep locally) ---
ppHX_NLO/Results/
# Results/ is excluded wholesale EXCEPT for the small, load-bearing test inputs
# below.  A negation cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is itself
# excluded, so the two enclosing levels are opened with a `*` re-exclusion
# rather than a plain directory rule.  Everything not named here (KiraStream,
# Pairs, KiraResult.wl, ...) stays ignored exactly as before.
ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/*
!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/
ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/*
!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/ClassForms/
