!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/BoundaryPeriods/
!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/HardClasses/
# The per-family transport-chart table is PROJECT data that the package
# deliberately does not ship (generality pass 2026-08-23), but it is 3 KiB
# and two acceptance tests read it, so it travels with the repository.
!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/TransportFamilyCharts.wl
# The frozen test fixtures (Codex 2026-08-25): the two full sector states
# are 132 MiB of run data and stay ignored; the REDUCED leading
# truncations the tests actually read are a few hundred KiB and are
# tracked, with their SHA-256 provenance manifest, so a fresh clone runs
# t_radical_denesting and t_kallen_q4_chart green.
!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/FamilyEpsFormsSolving/
ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/FamilyEpsFormsSolving/*
!ppHX_NNLO_DoubleReal/Results/UU_08_10_canonical/FamilyEpsFormsSolving/FrozenTestFixtures_2026-08-25/
